  "summary_en": "UK Act empowering the Secretary of State to make product regulations on risks, efficiency and environmental impact of products marketed or used in the UK, and metrology regulations on units and quantities. Covers enforcement powers, standards, online marketplaces and sanctions. Excludes aircraft, military equipment and medical devices. Not AI-specific.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
